    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mono Dodge is a fast-paced skill-based game designed for quick bursts of intense action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your friends in fast 1v1 duels \u2014 or enter Solo Dodge Mode and survive an endless barrage of skill shots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge or be deleted \u2013 Outplay your opponent or dodge for your life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Online \u2013 Face your friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Mode: Dodge Master \u2013 Survive as long as you can against relentless projectiles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to put down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're waiting in queue, dodging a match, or just want to sharpen your reflexes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mono Dodge is the perfect mini-challenge.</p>",
